    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Prétendre, soutenir, objecter",
     "texto": [
      "**Prétendre que** (to claim that), **soutenir que** (to maintain that), **objecter que** (to object that) take the indicative: **Il soutient que j'ai raison** (he maintains that I'm right).",
      "They are useful for giving your version against another."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Rétorquer, répliquer",
     "texto": [
      "**Rétorquer** and **répliquer** (to reply) indicate a quick, sharp answer: **Je rétorque que Paul insinue des choses** (I retort that Paul is insinuating things)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
